--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -48,3 +48,10 @@ Godot 4.7.x, Windows Desktop export.
 - Upgraded 3D citizens with limbs, clothing/height variation and walking animation.
 - Expanded city activity to 184 vehicles and 680 citizens with the existing banking UI preserved as an overlay.
 - Improved sky, filmic tone mapping and day/night lighting response.
+
+
+## v1.3 Bank vs City Finance HUD
+- Renamed the top-bar profit KPI to BANK PROFIT (LAST MO.) so it is clearly separated from government finances.
+- Renamed tax income to CITY TAX REVENUE (EST.) to make clear that it is gross city tax revenue.
+- Added CITY BALANCE (LAST MO.) showing the city government operating balance after public-service spending.
+- City balance turns green for a surplus and red for a deficit and refreshes with the live HUD.
